              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कार्यालयः — kāryālayaḥ — \"an office\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "kāryālaya is built from kārya \"work, business to be done\", formed from the root √kṛ \"do\" (MW), and ālaya \"dwelling, house\". The pairing for an office is modern."
            }
